    "summary_one_sentence": "In the shadow of Rome's criminal underworld, the son of a struggling restaurant owner teams up with a foreign woman to rescue her missing sister.",
    "summary_short": "Bound by desperation and shared purpose, an indebted restaurant owner's son agrees to help a foreign woman locate her missing sister in Rome. Their frantic search quickly plunges them into the dangerous crosshairs of the city's most ruthless syndicate members. Forced to rely on each other to survive, the pair must fight side by side through brutal conflict, forging an intense bond amidst constant peril. Ultimately, their perilous journey forces them to confront both external enemies and their own personal sacrifices.",
    "summary_long": "Facing crippling debt that threatens his family's legacy, the son of a local restaurant owner finds his life upended when a determined foreign woman arrives in Rome desperately searching for her lost sister. Driven by his own need for money and a deep sense of empathy, he agrees to serve as her guide through the city's treacherous underbelly. What begins as a simple missing-persons search rapidly escalates into a high-stakes struggle against Rome's most brutal criminal underworld. As they uncover clues, the pair attracts the attention of dangerous syndicate members who will stop at nothing to protect their secrets. Navigating hostile alleys, hidden hideouts, and violent ambushes, the two allies are forced to fight side by side to stay alive. Throughout the relentless ordeal, shared danger fuels a growing romantic tension and emotional trust between them. Each discovery brings them closer to the missing sister, but also deeper into a lethal trap engineered by the syndicate's leaders. Relying on sheer resilience, sharp wits, and martial skill, they execute a perilous rescue plan to break the syndicate's hold. In a explosive final confrontation, they risk everything to secure freedom and justice, forever transformed by the trial.",
    "synopsis": "Set against the stark contrast of Rome's historic beauty and its gritty criminal underbelly, this gripping action-drama follows a young man desperate to clear his family's overwhelming debts. His path crosses with an outsider who has arrived in the city on an urgent personal mission to locate her disappeared sister. Joining forces, the unexpected duo navigates a shadowy network of deceit, corruption, and violence. As they press deeper into dangerous territory, they encounter powerful figures in the Roman underworld who view their investigation as a threat. Fueled by high-octane action, dramatic personal stakes, and an emerging romance, the story explores themes of loyalty, sacrifice, and survival as two individuals from vastly different worlds unite against overwhelming odds.",
